





╭─ Help ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│Move (NORMAL)                                             Modes                                                       │
│  j/↓         move down (newer)                             i           write a message (INSERT)                      │
│  k/↑         move up (older; loads history at the top)     :           command line (COMMAND)                        │
│  g           go to the top                                 Esc         back to NORMAL / close the thread             │
│  G           go to the newest                              ?           this help                                     │
│  h/←         pane to the left                              q           quit                                          │
│  l/→         pane to the right                                                                                       │
│  Tab         next pane                                   Compose (INSERT)                                            │
│  S-Tab       previous pane                                 Enter       send                                          │
│                                                            A-Enter/C-j new line                                      │
│Conversations                                               Esc         back to NORMAL / close the thread             │
│  Enter       open conversation / thread of message                                                                   │
│  1–9         switch workspace                            Autocomplete (INSERT)                                       │
│  C-k/C-t     find a conversation (coming soon)             @ # :       suggest people, channels, emoji               │
│  C-b         show or hide the sidebar                      Tab/Enter   pick the suggestion (Esc closes)              │
│  <           narrower sidebar                              ↓/C-n       next suggestion                               │
│  >           wider sidebar                                 ↑/C-p       previous suggestion                           │
│                                                                                                                      │
│                                                          Commands (COMMAND)                                          │
│                                                            :q            quit                                        │
│                                                            :open <name>  open a conversation by name (#general, @ana)│
│                                                            :help         this help                                   │
│                                                                                                                      │
│Press any key to close.                                                                                               │
